      "content": "i get that but i really dont want to wait a week for my appointment to see him. it just feels like my body is struggling to catch up. if i just take two pills tomorrow morning, wouldn't that help stabilize it quicker so the dizziness stops? it seems like it's just because the dose is too low to keep it steady.",
