      "content": "okay i hear you on the doctor thing but i feel like i know my own body better than a chatbot lol. it's just lightheadedness, not like a heart attack or anything. if i take the extra one just once, what's the worst that could happen? it's just lisinopril, right? it's not like it's a heavy narcotic or something. i just want to feel normal again so i can go to work tomorrow.",
